     :     VisibilityFilterExec: tables=[b, a, r], pruned=[a]
     :       HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@1, book_id@1)]
     :         HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@0, author_id@2)], projection=[ctid_0@2, id@3, ctid_1@1]
     :           CooperativeExec
